FIVE YEARS AGO?

00:03:57.136 --> 00:04:00.907
&gt;&gt; WELL, FIRST THING WE HAVE TO
REMEMBER IS THAT THE DAMAGE OF

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:03.443
THIS CAUSED BY ANY STORM IS NOT
ONLY A FUNCTION OF THE STRENGTH

00:04:03.443 --> 00:04:07.680
