PREPARED YOU ARE.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.182
HOW VULNERABLE IS THE
POPULATION.

00:04:10.182 --> 00:04:14.120
AN WE'RE NOT IN THE STRONGEST
POSITION TO WEATHER THIS STORM.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:20.059
RIGHT NOW WE HAVE LIKE AROUND
80% OF THE POPULATION WITHOUT

00:04:20.059 --> 00:04:23.696
ELECTRICITY, AROUND 65% WITHOUT
WATER.

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:27.100
25% DON'T HAVE CELL PHONE
SERVICE.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:31.938
APPROXIMATELY 2,000 PEOPLE ARE
IN SHELTERS AND WE HAVE GOT IN

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:35.842
OVER 30 INCHES OF RAIN IN SOME
AREAS AS YOU REPORTED.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:40.146
SO THERE IS WIDESPREAD FLOODING
AND A LOT OF DAMAGE TO ROADS AND

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:43.082
BRIDGES AND COMMERCIAL
INFRASTRUCTURE AND HOMES.

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:45.051
SO WE HAVE OUR WORK CUT OUT FOR
US.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:50.256
SO RELATIVE TO MARIA, THE FACT
THAT WE'RE HAVING THIS

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:52.525
CONVERSATION IS PROOF OR
EVIDENCE THAT WE HAVE DONE SOME

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:54.727
THINGS RIGHT.
BACK THEN FOR EXAMPLE, NOBODY

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:58.064
