&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE SAID THAT THE POWER

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:10.176
GRID IN PUERTO RICO, YOU'VE
DESCRIBED IT AS FUNCTIONAL BUT

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:14.213
