THAT THE REPAIRS DONE IN THE

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:20.653
WAKE OF MARIA WERE NOT
SUFFICIENT TO PREVENT FOLKS

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:22.655
LOSING POWER AGAIN.
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:25.024
DEFINITELY.
WHAT HAPPENED AFTER MARIA, WE

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:27.460
FINISHED THE EMERGENCY REPAIRS
WHICH TOOK ABOUT A YEAR BY THE

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.098
WAY.
