00:05:32.098 --> 00:05:35.635
AUGUST OF 2018.
AND THEN ON THE SECOND STAGE OF

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:38.971
THE PROCESS WHEN WE START
THINKING ABOUT MAKING THE GRID

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:43.342
MORE SILL YENT AND STRENGTHENING
IT, WE HAVE A LOT OF IDEAS AND

00:05:43.342 --> 00:05:46.178
WE HAD A LOT OF DISCUSSIONS WITH
