00:05:46.178 --> 00:05:50.883
BUT VERY LITTLE PROGRESS MADE
DUE TO VERY -- SEVERAL DIFFERENT

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:53.453
REASONS.
BUT THE FACT IS THAT THE GRID

00:05:53.453 --> 00:05:58.157
HAS A LOT OF PATCHES AND THAT IS
WHAT WE'RE SEEING RIGHT NOW.

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:02.528
IT HASN'T BEEN STRENGTHED OR
MADE MORE RESILIENT SINCE MARIA.

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:05.898
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE HAD A FORMER STATE
SENATOR ON LAST HOUR WHO SAID

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:10.269
THAT OF THE $10 BILLION OR SO
GIVEN TO PUERTO RICO POST MARIA,

00:06:10.269 --> 00:06:15.842
THAT THE ONLY ABOUT $40 MILLION
OF $10 BILLION HAS BEEN SPENT SO

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:18.777
FAR.
