00:06:18.777 --> 00:06:24.083
A LOT OF THAT BURDEN FALLS ON
PUERTO RICO AND I WONDER IF YOU

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:25.485
AGREE OF THAT.
WHY HASN'T MORE OF THAT AID BEEN

00:06:25.485 --> 00:06:29.155
