BEEN SPENT ON WHAT FEMA CALLS

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:38.531
PERMANENT WORKS, LONG-TERM
PROJECTS TO STRENGTHEN THE GRID.

00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:44.337
AND I THINK THERE IS A LOT --
THERE IS A LOT OF BLAME TO GO

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:45.371
AROUND.
PART OF IT IS ON PUERTO RICO.

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:52.745
PART OF IT IS ON, YOU KNOW,
DIFFERENT --

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:53.846
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
&gt;&gt; AND ALSO THERE IS A LACK OF

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:57.717
AGREEMENT HOW TO PRECISELY
REBUILD THE GRADE TO MAKE IT

00:06:57.717 --> 00:07:00.386
MORE RESILIENCE.
THIS IS A BIG DEBATE.

00:07:00.386 --> 00:07:04.123
AND THIS IS HAPPENED EVERYWHERE,
BETWEEN RENEWABLES AND NATURAL

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:07.393
GAS.
