00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:55.207
STILL IN THE ISLAND, WE'RE
EXPECTING SOME MORE RAIN SOON.

00:07:55.207 --> 00:08:00.580
SO, THOSE ARE TOP OF MIND RIGHT
NOW TO ME IN TERMS OF WHAT NEEDS

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.050
